  "body": "All genuine offers will be seriously considered.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Auckland’s most sought-after coastal suburbs, this property presents a compelling opportunity for  buyers seeking a well-located site with long-term potential in a premium location.\r\n\r\nSet on a surprisingly spacious, private and sunny section, the property offers a rare chance to secure a foothold in the Orakei lifestyle while considering future options to suit your needs and aspirations.\r\n\r\nLocation is a key advantage, with convenient access to public transport, Tamaki Drive, Auckland CBD (approximately 7.9km away), Mission Bay, popular cafés and restaurants, a cinema, and a well-established shopping precinct.\r\n\r\nThe property is a cross-lease title and includes an existing dwelling and sleepout, both of which are offered on an \"as is, where is\" basis. Reflecting this, price expectations are based primarily on the underlying land opportunity rather than the condition or value of the existing improvements.\r\n\r\nProspective purchasers are encouraged to inspect the property in person to fully appreciate the setting, location, sunshine, privacy, and potential that this site has to offer.",
